    title "47 tests pass, clippy clean under -D warnings, formatting clean. New coverage: statutory ordinals, a charge refused without elements, an atomic charge write, an attributed assessment reaching the element matrix, a refused contradictory second assessment, refused unknown and cross-case endpoints, and two schema tests proving the author trigger fires and that a hand-inserted cross-case element_link never surfaces in element_matrix or offense_comparison. Also verified by hand that migration 0004 re-runs against a database created before it existed."
