    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:57fa7e35998c79b3ab1e656a86d3c71bb740a059
    command "cargo fmt --check && cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings && cargo test --all-features"
    summary """
        47 tests pass, clippy clean under -D warnings, formatting clean. New coverage: statutory ordinals, a charge refused without elements, an atomic charge write, an attributed assessment reaching the element matrix, a refused contradictory second assessment, refused unknown and cross-case endpoints, and two schema tests proving the author trigger fires and that a hand-inserted cross-case element_link never surfaces in element_matrix or offense_comparison. Also verified by hand that migration 0004 re-runs against a database created before it existed.
